01:15:44.350 --> 01:15:59.180
Kennedy Kerr: Lauren stressed the importance of using… of placing the, electrodes parallel to the muscle fibers, so literally just looking at what direction they're going is super important to make sure you're actually recording that difference in voltage along the same muscle.

