443
01:16:32.580 --> 01:16:52.330
Kennedy Kerr: That's new prep. Okay? And then also, you want to secure the electrodes down to the person to prevent movement artifact. So like in this little wired EMG down here, you'd put the electrodes on and then tape down that box. So it's not like waving around which can introduce noise into your signal.

