01:27:22.420 --> 01:27:25.999
Lauren Infantino: high pass filter pass anything higher.

499
01:27:26.200 --> 01:27:35.890
Lauren Infantino: We'll take our cutoff frequency again at 180 Hertz, and we'll tell the system. Pass anything higher than 180 Hertz, 200 Hertz, 250 Hertz, etc.

