01:28:08.910 --> 01:28:23.510
Lauren Infantino: So when we see this, we'll want to excise that out. We'll want to take it and we'll want to notch filter that out. So you can see the next step is taking that out, eliminating that 50Hz frequencies. They've also done a bandpass filter.

505
01:28:23.510 --> 01:28:38.839
Lauren Infantino: and you can see the resulting, best Fourier transformation of the raw and the process signal, and we've gotten rid of that interference. That's not actually EMG or muscle activation, but it's just noise coming from the external environment.

